📌Definition:-Abstraction is hiding internal implementation & just highlighting the setup services that we are offering.

Real life example:- abstraction hiding internal implementation (iska matlab: car ke andar ke internal components jaise engine kaise kaam karta hai, gearbox, clutch, brakes ka internal system, fuel combustion process — yeh sab user se chhupa hota hai , Jo component ke dwara car banaa Ho Jo ki jarurat nahin hota hai user ke liye, user ko actual component provide Kiya jata hai jo jarurat hai usse, na ki internal things jisko jaaan ke  kuchh nahin kar sakta hai jo jarurat hai jo usmein)
 & just highlighting the setup services that we are offering(iska matlab: kar ka vah components Jo user ko dikhaya jata hai, Jo actually need hota hai like 
Steering ghumao → car turn kare
Accelerator dabao → speed badhe
Brake dabao → car ruk jaaye
Gear change karo → smooth )
